      "rationale": "Pace learning to allow for reflection and application of new skills by introducing inclusive leadership behaviors that make you a more successful leader. This course helps learners understand how to support flexible work environments and better work-life integration, identify barriers to work-life effectiveness, and create solutions."
    },
    {
      "step": 9,
      "course_id": "EDX3406",
      "rationale": "Foster intrinsic motivation by applying real-world examples and case studies to develop inclusive leadership skills. This course helps learners understand behavioral science insights that allow you to create a more inclusive organization, identify DEI issues in the workplace, and implement practical interventions to improve inclusiveness."
    },
    {
      "step": 10,
      "course_id": "EDX3400",
      "rationale": "Gradually increase cognitive load by introducing advanced leadership skills, such as women's leadership program. This course helps learners develop practical tools and strategies to improve their impact and lead others more effectively, understand their unique leadership style, strengths, and limiting behaviors, and strengthen and build their network within their context."
    }
  ]
}

